     - Totals footer reloads via $.get to /PIMS/Invoice/GetInvoiceTotals after filter apply.
     - PHASE 14 FIX: deleteInvoice() now sends RequestVerificationToken header on DELETE AJAX
       call — resolves CSRF gap flagged in Phase 14 security gate review of InvoiceController.cs.
   PRESERVED:
